*
* Bindings for Honeycomb Aeronautical Charlie Rudder Pedal
*
* HID: descriptor for:Honeycomb Aeronautical Charlie Rudder Pedal_0
* [INFO]:input bytes: 05 01 09 04 A1 01 05 01 09 01 A1 01 09 30 09 31 09 32 15 00 26 FF 03 95 03 75 10 81 02 C0 C0
********************************************************************
